return ['domain'=>'simple-ldap-login','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'Simple LDAP Login 2.0.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T15:26:17+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30 00:00+0000','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['Simple LDAP Login'=>'Simple LDAP Login','https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login'=>'https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login','Connect WordPress accounts to Active Directory or OpenLDAP.'=>'將 WordPress 帳戶連接到 Active Directory 或 OpenLDAP。','Clif Griffin Development Inc.'=>'Clif Griffin Development Inc.','https://clifgriffin.com'=>'https://clifgriffin.com','Your directory account is suspended. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的目錄帳戶已停用。請聯絡網站管理員。','The directory identity has changed. Contact your site administrator.'=>'目錄身分已變更。請聯絡網站管理員。','User data'=>'用戶數據','Single sign-on'=>'單一登入','Accounts'=>'帳戶','Audit'=>'稽核','Profile updates'=>'個人資料更新','Copy standard LDAP profile fields to existing WordPress accounts at login. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded.'=>'登入時將標準 LDAP 個人資料欄位複製到現有的 WordPress 帳戶。復原帳戶和超級管理員不在處理範圍內。','Update profiles at login'=>'登入時更新個人資料','Replace names, email, and website with directory values. Empty directory values clear the field. A missing or invalid email stops the update.'=>'以目錄值取代姓名、電子郵件和網站。目錄值為空時會清空對應欄位。電子郵件缺漏或無效時會停止更新。','Custom user fields'=>'自定義用戶字段','Copy LDAP fields, such as phone number or department, to WordPress at login. Your theme or other plugins can use these values.'=>'在登錄時將 LDAP 欄位（例如電話號碼或部門）複製到 WordPress。您的主題或其他插件可以使用這些值。','Field mappings'=>'字段映射','LDAP attribute'=>'LDAP 屬性','WordPress meta key'=>'WordPress 中繼資料索引鍵','Type'=>'類型','Text'=>'文字','Number'=>'數字','Group roles'=>'群組角色','Set the WordPress role from LDAP groups at each login. The first matching rule applies. If no rule matches, use the default role. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded.'=>'每次登入時依 LDAP 群組設定 WordPress 角色。套用第一條符合的規則。若沒有規則符合，則使用預設角色。復原帳戶和超級管理員不在處理範圍內。','Group-to-role rules'=>'群組對應角色規則','LDAP group'=>'LDAP 群組','WordPress role'=>'WordPress 角色','Enterprise includes scheduled account import, scheduled access removal, and multisite membership rules. Your saved settings are kept.'=>'Enterprise 包含排程帳號匯入、排程存取權限移除及多站台成員規則。已儲存的設定會保留。','View Enterprise upgrade'=>'檢視 Enterprise 升級','Enterprise account settings'=>'Enterprise 帳號設定','Multisite membership'=>'多站台成員資格','Assign site membership and roles from directory groups. The first matching rule for each site applies. These rules replace the group role rules for network activation.'=>'依目錄群組指派網站成員資格與角色。每個網站套用第一條符合的規則。在整個網誌網路啟用時，這些規則會取代群組角色規則。','Group-to-site rules'=>'群組對應網站規則','Site ID'=>'網站 ID','Scheduled account import'=>'排程匯入帳戶','Import directory accounts once per hour through WordPress scheduled tasks. Set a search account on Connection. Site traffic or a system task must run WordPress cron.'=>'透過 WordPress 排程工作每小時匯入一次目錄帳戶。請在「連線」設定搜尋帳戶。需要透過網站流量或系統工作執行 WordPress cron。','Enable scheduled import'=>'啟用排程匯入','Create accounts without a first login. Existing local accounts are excluded. No user session is created.'=>'不必首次登入即可建立帳戶。現有本機帳戶不在處理範圍內。不會建立使用者工作階段。','Import Base DN'=>'匯入基底 DN','Leave blank to use the connection Base DN.'=>'留空可使用連線的基底 DN。','Import groups'=>'匯入群組','One group per line. Import users in at least one group. Leave blank to import all users below the Import Base DN. Login group restrictions also apply.'=>'每行輸入一個群組。匯入至少屬於其中一個群組的使用者。留空可匯入「匯入基底 DN」之下的所有使用者。登入群組限制同樣適用。','Scheduled access removal'=>'排程移除存取權','Check managed directory accounts once per hour. A confirmed missing account, disabled AD account, changed directory identity, or failed login group rule suspends access and ends all WordPress sessions. Connection errors keep the current access state.'=>'每小時檢查一次受管理的目錄帳戶。確認帳戶不存在、AD 帳戶已停用、目錄身分已變更或不符合登入群組規則時，會停用存取權並結束所有 WordPress 工作階段。連線錯誤不會變更目前的存取狀態。','Enable scheduled access removal'=>'啟用排程移除存取權','Keep user data and content. Restore access after a later successful directory check. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded. Existing suspensions remain if the task or license stops.'=>'保留使用者資料和內容。後續目錄檢查成功後會還原存取權。復原帳戶和超級管理員不在處理範圍內。如果工作停止或授權失效，現有停用狀態仍會保留。','Add row'=>'新增列','Remove row'=>'移除列','Custom field storage'=>'自定義字段存儲','Leave the defaults unless your integration uses different user meta keys.'=>'除非您的集成使用不同的用戶元數據鍵，否則保留默認值。','LDAP value suffix'=>'LDAP 值後綴','Stores the LDAP value, such as phone_ldap.'=>'存儲 LDAP 值，例如 phone_ldap。','WordPress value suffix'=>'WordPress 值後綴','Stores the editable WordPress value, such as phone_wp.'=>'存儲可編輯的 WordPress 值，例如 phone_wp。','Single sign-on (SSO)'=>'單一登入 (SSO)','Sign users in to WordPress after your web server authenticates them.'=>'在您的網絡伺服器驗證用戶後，將用戶登錄到 WordPress。','Enable single sign-on'=>'啟用單一登錄','Users do not need a second login for WordPress.'=>'用戶不需要第二次登錄 WordPress。','Configure your web server to authenticate users and set REMOTE_USER. Enter an LDAP search account on Connection.'=>'配置您的網絡伺服器以驗證用戶並設置 REMOTE_USER。在連接中輸入 LDAP 搜索帳戶。','Do not copy browser headers into REMOTE_USER. Block access that bypasses web server authentication.'=>'不要將瀏覽器標頭複製到 REMOTE_USER。阻止繞過網絡伺服器身份驗證的訪問。','Web server authentication'=>'網絡伺服器身份驗證','REMOTE_USER is present.'=>'REMOTE_USER 存在。','REMOTE_USER is missing. Check the web server configuration.'=>'REMOTE_USER 缺失。檢查網絡伺服器配置。','An Enterprise license is required to collect, read, or export audit history. Existing records are kept.'=>'收集、檢視或匯出稽核歷程需要 Enterprise 授權。現有記錄會保留。','Enterprise audit settings'=>'Enterprise 稽核設定','Audit history'=>'稽核記錄','Record login results and account changes. Records contain event names and account IDs. Passwords, directory field values, and credentials are excluded.'=>'記錄登入結果和帳戶變更。記錄包含事件名稱與帳戶 ID。不記錄密碼、目錄欄位值或認證資訊。','Enable audit history'=>'啟用稽核記錄','Store private WordPress records. Collection is off by default. Existing records remain when collection stops.'=>'儲存不公開的 WordPress 記錄。預設關閉收集。停止收集時會保留現有記錄。','Retention (days)'=>'保留期限（天）','Default: 30. Range: 1 to 3650. A daily task removes older records while collection is enabled.'=>'預設值：30。範圍：1 到 3650。啟用收集期間，每日工作會移除過期記錄。','Export CSV'=>'匯出 CSV','Latest 50 records. The export includes all retained records in this scope. Times use UTC.'=>'最近 50 筆記錄。匯出包含目前範圍內保留的所有記錄。時間使用 UTC。','Time (UTC)'=>'時間（UTC）','Event'=>'事件','Actor ID'=>'操作人員 ID','User ID'=>'使用者 ID','You do not have permission to export these records.'=>'您沒有匯出這些記錄的權限。','Activate an Enterprise license to change these settings. Your saved settings are kept.'=>'啟用 Enterprise 授權後才能變更這些設定。已儲存的設定會保留。','A Pro setting is not valid. Check the format and role names.'=>'某項 Pro 設定無效。請檢查格式與角色名稱。','The update was stopped. Activate Simple LDAP Login Pro to restore LDAP login.'=>'更新已停止。啟用 Simple LDAP Login Pro 以恢復 LDAP 登入。','Update blocked: This package does not include all Pro files. To install Free, deactivate the plugin first. Your installed files and settings are unchanged.'=>'更新被阻止：此套件不包含所有 Pro 檔案。要安裝免費版本，請先停用插件。您已安裝的檔案和設定保持不變。','WordPress could not reactivate the plugin.'=>'WordPress 無法重新啟用插件。','Simple LDAP Login needs PHP 8.1 or later.'=>'Simple LDAP Login 需要 PHP 8.1 或更高版本。','Plugin files are missing. Reinstall Simple LDAP Login from the release ZIP.'=>'插件文件缺失。從發行 ZIP 重新安裝 Simple LDAP Login。','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您沒有權限更改這些設置。','The settings scope has changed. Open the settings page and try again.'=>'設置範圍已更改。打開設置頁面並重試。','You do not have permission to view these settings.'=>'您沒有權限查看這些設置。','LDAP login settings'=>'LDAP 登錄設置','Connect to LDAP, then test a login before enabling authentication.'=>'連接到 LDAP，然後在啟用身份驗證之前測試登錄。','LDAP login and SSO are disabled by SLL_DISABLE_LDAP in wp-config.php.'=>'LDAP 登錄和 SSO 被 wp-config.php 中的 SLL_DISABLE_LDAP 禁用。','Your saved settings use backup LDAP servers, SSO, or custom user fields. Install Simple LDAP Login Pro to use these features. Your settings are kept.'=>'儲存的設定使用了備用 LDAP 伺服器、SSO 或自訂使用者欄位。請安裝 Simple LDAP Login Pro 以使用這些功能。您的設定會保留。','The saved LDAP search password cannot be read. Enter it again on the Connection tab.'=>'無法讀取已保存的 LDAP 搜索密碼。請在連接選項卡上重新輸入。','PHP LDAP is missing. Ask your host to install it before enabling LDAP login.'=>'缺少 PHP LDAP。請向您的主機請求安裝它，然後再啟用 LDAP 登入。','LDAP passwords are sent without encryption. Use StartTLS or LDAPS if your server supports it.'=>'LDAP 密碼以未加密的方式發送。如果您的伺服器支持，請使用 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','Save settings'=>'保存設置','Settings on other tabs are kept.'=>'其他選項卡上的設置將被保留。','LDAP connection'=>'LDAP 連接','LDAP login'=>'LDAP 登入','Enable LDAP authentication.'=>'啟用 LDAP 認證。','Directory type'=>'目錄類型','Active Directory'=>'Active Directory','OpenLDAP / other LDAP directory'=>'OpenLDAP / 其他 LDAP 目錄','LDAP servers'=>'LDAP 伺服器','One hostname or IP address per line. An active Pro or Enterprise license enables backup servers. Without an active license, only the first server is used.'=>'每行輸入一個主機名稱或 IP 位址。有效的 Pro 或 Enterprise 授權可啟用備用伺服器。沒有有效授權時，僅使用第一個伺服器。','Base DN'=>'基本 DN','Where to search for users. Example: DC=example,DC=org.'=>'用於搜索用戶的位置。示例：DC=example,DC=org。','Username suffix'=>'用戶名後綴','Added to usernames without a domain. Example: @example.org.'=>'添加到沒有域的用戶名。示例：@example.org。','Windows domain'=>'Windows 域','Short domain name, such as EXAMPLE. Takes priority over the username suffix.'=>'短域名，例如 EXAMPLE。優先於用戶名後綴。','Connection security'=>'連接安全性','TLS requires a trusted server certificate.'=>'TLS 需要受信任的伺服器證書。','StartTLS (recommended)'=>'StartTLS（推薦）','LDAPS'=>'LDAPS','Unencrypted LDAP'=>'未加密的 LDAP','Unencrypted LDAP requires permission on the Advanced tab.'=>'未加密的 LDAP 需要在高級選項卡上授權。','Port'=>'端口','389 for StartTLS; 636 for LDAPS.'=>'StartTLS 使用 389；LDAPS 使用 636。','Search subfolders'=>'搜索子文件夾','Search all organizational units below the Base DN.'=>'搜索基本 DN 下面的所有組織單位。','LDAP search account'=>'LDAP 搜索帳戶','An LDAP account with read access to users and groups.'=>'具有用戶和群組讀取權限的 LDAP 帳戶。','Search account'=>'搜索帳戶','LDAP bind DN or account name.'=>'LDAP 綁定 DN 或帳戶名稱。','Search account password'=>'搜索帳戶密碼','Leave blank to keep the saved password.'=>'留空以保留已保存的密碼。','Login rules'=>'登入規則','Require LDAP passwords'=>'要求 LDAP 密碼','Block WordPress passwords except for recovery access.'=>'阻止 WordPress 密碼，僅限於恢復訪問。','Local recovery access'=>'本地恢復訪問','Selected administrators'=>'選定的管理員','All super administrators (legacy)'=>'所有超級管理員（舊版）','All administrators (legacy)'=>'所有管理員（舊版）','Off'=>'關閉','Choose who can use a WordPress password when LDAP passwords are required.'=>'選擇在要求 LDAP 密碼時可以使用 WordPress 密碼的用戶。','Automatic account creation'=>'自動帳戶創建','Create a WordPress account on the first successful LDAP login.'=>'在第一次成功的 LDAP 登入時創建 WordPress 帳戶。','Default role'=>'默認角色','For new accounts only.'=>'僅適用於新帳戶。','Required groups'=>'所需群組','One group name per line. Users must belong to at least one. Leave blank to allow all LDAP users.'=>'每行一個群組名稱。用戶必須至少屬於一個。留空以允許所有 LDAP 用戶。','Recovery accounts'=>'恢復帳戶','For Selected administrators only. Use separate local accounts with WordPress passwords. Hold Ctrl or Command to select multiple accounts.'=>'僅適用於選定的管理員。使用單獨的本地帳戶和 WordPress 密碼。按住 Ctrl 或 Command 以選擇多個帳戶。','Connection options'=>'連接選項','Change these only if the default values do not work with your directory.'=>'僅在默認值無法與您的目錄配合使用時更改這些設置。','LDAP timeout (seconds)'=>'LDAP 超時（秒）','Maximum wait for an LDAP operation. Default: 5 seconds.'=>'LDAP 操作的最大等待時間。默認：5 秒。','Login attribute'=>'登入屬性','Attribute used to find users. Default: uid.'=>'用於查找用戶的屬性。默認：uid。','Allow unencrypted LDAP'=>'允許未加密的 LDAP','Allow passwords to be sent without encryption.'=>'允許以未加密的方式發送密碼。','Group search'=>'群組搜尋','Group base DN'=>'群組基本 DN','Leave blank to use the user Base DN.'=>'留空以使用使用者基本 DN。','Group name attribute'=>'群組名稱屬性','Default: cn.'=>'預設：cn。','Group member attribute'=>'群組成員屬性','Default: memberUid. Use member or uniqueMember if groups store user DNs.'=>'預設：memberUid。如果群組儲存使用者 DN，請使用 member 或 uniqueMember。','Profile attributes'=>'個人資料屬性','LDAP attributes copied to new WordPress accounts.'=>'複製到新 WordPress 帳戶的 LDAP 屬性。','First name attribute'=>'名字屬性','Last name attribute'=>'姓氏屬性','Email attribute'=>'電子郵件屬性','Website attribute'=>'網站屬性','Data retention'=>'資料保留','Delete settings when removing the plugin'=>'移除插件時刪除設定','Delete saved settings and LDAP credentials when WordPress deletes the plugin. Keep user accounts.'=>'當 WordPress 刪除插件時，刪除已儲存的設定和 LDAP 憑證。保留使用者帳戶。','Documentation'=>'文件','Support'=>'支援','Recovery'=>'恢復','If you are locked out, rename the simple-ldap-login folder using your hosting file manager. Log in with a WordPress administrator password, then restore the folder and correct the settings.'=>'如果您被鎖定，請使用您的主機檔案管理器重新命名 simple-ldap-login 資料夾。使用 WordPress 管理員密碼登入，然後恢復資料夾並修正設定。','For certificate errors, ask your host to configure the trusted LDAP certificate authority.'=>'對於證書錯誤，請要求您的主機配置受信任的 LDAP 證書授權。','LDAP tests'=>'LDAP 測試','Tests use saved settings.'=>'測試使用已儲存的設定。','Save your settings, then run both tests. Keep this administrator session open.'=>'儲存您的設定，然後運行兩個測試。保持此管理員會話開啟。','Tests check the connection, password, and required groups. They do not create accounts or sign users in.'=>'測試檢查連接、密碼和所需的群組。它們不會創建帳戶或登入使用者。','Check Connection'=>'檢查連線','Connect to LDAP and test the search account, if set.'=>'連接到 LDAP 並測試搜尋帳戶（如果已設置）。','Test LDAP login'=>'測試 LDAP 登入','Check an LDAP username, password, and group membership.'=>'檢查 LDAP 使用者名稱、密碼和群組成員資格。','LDAP username'=>'LDAP 使用者名稱','LDAP password'=>'LDAP 密碼','After both tests pass, enable LDAP and try logging in from another browser.'=>'在兩個測試通過後，啟用 LDAP 並嘗試從另一個瀏覽器登入。','Settings saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','Connection test passed.'=>'連接測試通過。','Cannot connect to LDAP. Check the server, port, TLS certificate, and search account.'=>'無法連接到 LDAP。檢查伺服器、端口、TLS 證書和搜尋帳戶。','LDAP login test passed. No account was created.'=>'LDAP 登入測試通過。未創建帳戶。','LDAP login test failed. Check the username, password, and required groups.'=>'LDAP 登入測試失敗。檢查使用者名稱、密碼和所需的群組。','Could not save settings. Check the values and try again.'=>'無法儲存設定。檢查值並重試。','Connection'=>'連接','Access'=>'訪問','Advanced'=>'進階','Testing'=>'測試','Your LDAP login is valid, but you need a WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 登入有效，但您需要一個 WordPress 帳戶。請聯繫您的網站管理員。','Your LDAP username is not a valid WordPress username. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 使用者名稱不是有效的 WordPress 使用者名稱。請聯繫您的網站管理員。','The default WordPress role is not available. Contact your site administrator.'=>'預設的 WordPress 角色不可用。請聯繫您的網站管理員。','Could not create your WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'無法創建您的 WordPress 帳戶。請聯繫您的網站管理員。','Use your WordPress password for this recovery account.'=>'使用您的 WordPress 密碼作為此恢復帳戶。','License'=>'許可證','Go Pro'=>'升級至 Pro','Could not check your license. Features in your last verified plan remain active. Try again on the License tab.'=>'無法檢查授權。上次驗證的方案中的功能仍然有效。請在「授權」分頁中再試一次。','Your license has expired. Paid features are off. Renew your license, then select Check license on the License tab.'=>'授權已到期。付費功能已關閉。請續訂授權，然後在「授權」分頁中選取「檢查授權」。','Your license plan has not been verified. Select Check license on the License tab. Paid features stay off until the plan is verified.'=>'授權方案尚未驗證。請在「授權」分頁中選取「檢查授權」。在方案通過驗證前，付費功能會保持關閉。','Activate your Pro or Enterprise license on the License tab to use paid features.'=>'在「授權」分頁中啟用 Pro 或 Enterprise 授權，即可使用付費功能。','Backup LDAP servers'=>'備用 LDAP 伺服器','Try the next server if a directory server cannot be reached. All servers must use the same directory.'=>'如果無法連線至目錄伺服器，則嘗試下一個伺服器。所有伺服器必須使用同一個目錄。','Give staff one less password prompt. Sign in through your web server with Kerberos, NTLM, or other server authentication.'=>'減少員工輸入密碼的次數。透過網頁伺服器使用 Kerberos、NTLM 或其他伺服器驗證方式登入。','Turn directory groups into WordPress roles at each login. Give editors, authors, and other teams the access they need.'=>'每次登入時依據目錄群組指派 WordPress 角色。為編輯、作者及其他團隊提供所需的存取權限。','Keep names, email addresses, and websites current. Copy directory values to existing WordPress profiles at login.'=>'保持姓名、電子郵件地址及網站資訊為最新狀態。登入時將目錄中的值複製至現有 WordPress 個人資料。','Put phone numbers, departments, and other LDAP fields to work in WordPress. Map text and number fields for your theme or plugins.'=>'在 WordPress 中使用電話號碼、部門及其他 LDAP 欄位。為佈景主題或外掛對應文字與數字欄位。','Have accounts ready before the first login. Import directory users each hour, with filters for groups and directory location.'=>'在首次登入前備妥帳號。每小時匯入目錄使用者，並依群組與目錄位置篩選。','Check managed accounts each hour. Suspend access and end sessions when directory checks confirm removal or lost access. Keep user content.'=>'每小時檢查受管理的帳號。當目錄檢查確認帳號已移除或存取權限已失去時，暫停存取並結束工作階段。保留使用者內容。','Manage access across your WordPress network. Use directory groups to assign site membership and roles, then remove access when groups change.'=>'管理整個 WordPress 網路的存取權限。使用目錄群組指派站台成員資格與角色，並在群組變更時移除存取權限。','Audit history and CSV export'=>'稽核歷程與 CSV 匯出','See login results, role changes, imports, and access changes in one place. Set record retention and export the history to CSV.'=>'集中檢視登入結果、角色變更、匯入及存取權限變更。設定記錄保留期限，並將歷程匯出為 CSV。','Simple LDAP Login Pro and Enterprise'=>'Simple LDAP Login Pro 與 Enterprise','Choose your LDAP plan.'=>'選擇 LDAP 方案。','Pro adds single sign-on and user data updates. Enterprise adds scheduled account management, multisite membership rules, and audit history.'=>'Pro 新增單一登入及使用者資料更新。Enterprise 新增排程帳號管理、多站台成員規則及稽核歷程。','Both plans cover one site. Your existing LDAP settings stay in place.'=>'兩種方案均適用於一個站台。現有 LDAP 設定會保留。','Pro — $99/year'=>'Pro — 每年 $99','Enterprise — $499/year'=>'Enterprise — 每年 $499','All Free features, plus:'=>'所有 Free 功能，另加：','Everything in Pro, plus:'=>'所有 Pro 功能，另加：','Buy Pro'=>'購買 Pro','Get Enterprise'=>'取得 Enterprise','Buy Enterprise'=>'購買 Enterprise','Scheduled tasks use WordPress cron and need site traffic or a system task. Single sign-on requires web server authentication. Multisite rules require network activation.'=>'排程工作使用 WordPress cron，需要站台流量或系統工作觸發。單一登入需要網頁伺服器驗證。多站台規則需要在網路中啟用外掛。','Your saved license needs a plan check. Install Pro, then select Check license on the License tab.'=>'已儲存的授權需要檢查方案。請安裝 Pro，然後在「授權」分頁中選取「檢查授權」。','After purchase, replace Free with the Pro ZIP from your receipt. Then activate your license on the License tab in Pro. Your LDAP settings stay in place.'=>'購買後，請使用收據中的 Pro ZIP 取代 Free。然後在 Pro 的「授權」分頁中啟用授權。LDAP 設定會保留。','PaidCommunities handles checkout. It receives your IP address, browser details, and the information you enter at checkout. LDAP credentials and user records are not sent.'=>'PaidCommunities 處理結帳。它會接收您的 IP 位址、瀏覽器詳細資訊及結帳時輸入的資訊。不會傳送 LDAP 認證資料及使用者記錄。','License status updated.'=>'許可證狀態已更新。','Could not verify the license. Check your key and connection, then try again.'=>'無法驗證許可證。檢查您的密鑰和連接，然後再試一次。','Enter the license key from your purchase receipt.'=>'輸入您購買收據上的許可證密鑰。','Plan not verified'=>'方案未驗證','Expired'=>'已過期','Inactive'=>'未啟用','License status'=>'許可證狀態','Active'=>'有效','Not activated'=>'未激活','Current plan'=>'目前方案','Enterprise'=>'Enterprise','Pro'=>'Pro','Enterprise adds scheduled account import and access removal, multisite membership rules, and audit history with CSV export.'=>'Enterprise 新增排程帳號匯入與存取權限移除、多站台成員規則，以及支援 CSV 匯出的稽核歷程。','Get Enterprise opens checkout for a new license. It does not change or cancel your Pro subscription. Manage that subscription separately through PaidCommunities. After purchase, deactivate this key, choose Enterprise, and activate the new key.'=>'「取得 Enterprise」會開啟新授權的結帳頁面。它不會變更或取消您的 Pro 訂閱。請透過 PaidCommunities 個別管理該訂閱。購買後，停用此金鑰、選擇 Enterprise，再啟用新金鑰。','Purchased plan'=>'已購方案','Choose the plan on your purchase receipt. This choice is used only when activating a key. A license check verifies which features you can use.'=>'選擇購買收據上的方案。此選項僅用於啟用金鑰時。授權檢查會驗證您可使用的功能。','License key'=>'許可證密鑰','Activate license'=>'激活許可證','Deactivate license'=>'停用許可證','Check license'=>'檢查許可證','PaidCommunities handles licenses. Activation sends your license key, site domain, plugin version, and server IP address. License checks send site details. LDAP credentials and user records are not sent.'=>'PaidCommunities 管理授權。啟用時會傳送授權金鑰、站台網域、外掛版本及伺服器 IP 位址。授權檢查會傳送站台詳細資訊。不會傳送 LDAP 認證資料及使用者記錄。','Select a license action.'=>'選擇一個許可證操作。','Activating license…'=>'正在激活许可证…','Deactivating license…'=>'正在停用许可证…','License error'=>'许可证错误','License updated'=>'许可证已更新','LDAP login failed. Check your username and password or contact your site administrator.'=>'LDAP 登入失敗。檢查您的使用者名稱和密碼或聯繫您的網站管理員。','Your account is not allowed to log in to this site.'=>'您的帳戶不允許登錄此網站。','LDAP login is unavailable. Contact your site administrator.'=>'LDAP 登錄不可用。請聯繫您的網站管理員。','PHP OpenSSL is required to save the LDAP search password.'=>'需要 PHP OpenSSL 來保存 LDAP 搜索密碼。','Could not read or save the LDAP search password. Enter it again. If this continues, ask your host to check OpenSSL and the encryption key.'=>'無法讀取或保存 LDAP 搜索密碼。請重新輸入。如果問題持續，請要求您的主機檢查 OpenSSL 和加密密鑰。','Select a recovery account on the Access tab, or turn local recovery access Off.'=>'在訪問選項卡上選擇一個恢復帳戶，或將本地恢復訪問關閉。','Enable Allow unencrypted LDAP on the Advanced tab, or choose StartTLS or LDAPS.'=>'在高級選項卡上啟用允許未加密的 LDAP，或選擇 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','A custom field mapping uses a protected or invalid WordPress user meta key.'=>'自定義字段映射使用了受保護或無效的 WordPress 用戶元數據鍵。','Enter a Base DN and at least one LDAP server before enabling LDAP login.'=>'在啟用 LDAP 登錄之前，請輸入基本 DN 和至少一個 LDAP 伺服器。','WordPress could not save the settings. Try again.'=>'WordPress 無法保存設置。請重試。','LDAP protocol version'=>'LDAP 協議版本','LDAP timeout'=>'LDAP 超時','Check the submitted settings. No changes were saved.'=>'檢查提交的設置。未保存任何更改。','Check %s. No changes were saved.'=>'檢查 %s。未保存任何更改。']];